        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note 1: This game follows the same setting and focuses on 2 new routes: Roya &amp; Chain. You don't need to play the base game to enjoy this version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note 2: The secret route and side stories are still in development. I planned these for early 2026. They come as a free update.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Nights - Reflections is a horror/romance visual novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Content warnings: jumpscares, depictions of death/dying, murder,  cannibalism, blood, mild cursing, decapitation, dismemberment, violence, impalement, firearms, use of alcohol</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You live in a small, peaceful town. Every day is the same as any other; boring. Right when you wish for something exciting to happen, strange things start to occur, stemming from the nearby forest. If that isn't enough, the locals have begun disappearing. At the same time, you meet six mysterious men. Will you discover the truth before becoming the next target?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♦ 2 routes, each with a unique storyline </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♦ 12 possible endings, 6 per storyline </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♦ At least 10 hours playtime - 70,000 - 85,000 words per storyline. Total 178,988 words </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♦ 8+ side characters, vary per route.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♦ 30 CG art/5 cut scenes </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♦ 70 Original background art </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♦ 50 Original soundtracks </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♦ 22 Achievements  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♦ Bonus material</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach all 16 endings to unlock bonus content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141140/extras/03fcbe1db74cbcb0fad1875a17f7fc34.avif?t=1765835931\" width=182 height=178 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Miyoko</strong> (renamable) - You play as a college girl trapped in the monotony of everyday life. Miyoko craves adventure and excitement, but she’s careful not to lose herself chasing danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141140/extras/87247680081e18c1da0e10577f7c6300.avif?t=1765835931\" width=182 height=178 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roya</strong> - A flirtatious young man who, after meeting the heroine, seems drawn to her for reasons beyond simple attraction. His true motives remain a mystery. Though his uniform marks him as a student from her school, she’s certain she’s never seen him before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141140/extras/994dc0a016fa0c6f2451bdfd4fc1cb2f.avif?t=1765835931\" width=182 height=178 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chain</strong> - A man of few words, he only speaks when it truly matters or to make a cutting comment. His quiet nature, paired with his strange activities, has fueled rumors that he’s connected to the murders.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note 1: This game follows the same setting and focuses on 2 new routes: Roya &amp; Chain. You don't need to play the base game to enjoy this version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note 2: The secret route and side stories are still in development. I planned these for early 2026. They come as a free update.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Nights - Reflections is a horror/romance visual novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Content warnings: jumpscares, depictions of death/dying, murder,  cannibalism, blood, mild cursing, decapitation, dismemberment, violence, impalement, firearms, use of alcohol</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You live in a small, peaceful town. Every day is the same as any other; boring. Right when you wish for something exciting to happen, strange things start to occur, stemming from the nearby forest. If that isn't enough, the locals have begun disappearing. At the same time, you meet six mysterious men. Will you discover the truth before becoming the next target?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♦ 2 routes, each with a unique storyline </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♦ 12 possible endings, 6 per storyline </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♦ At least 10 hours playtime - 70,000 - 85,000 words per storyline. Total 178,988 words </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♦ 8+ side characters, vary per route.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♦ 30 CG art/5 cut scenes </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♦ 70 Original background art </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♦ 50 Original soundtracks </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♦ 22 Achievements  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♦ Bonus material</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach all 16 endings to unlock bonus content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141140/extras/03fcbe1db74cbcb0fad1875a17f7fc34.avif?t=1765835931\" width=182 height=178 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Miyoko</strong> (renamable) - You play as a college girl trapped in the monotony of everyday life. Miyoko craves adventure and excitement, but she’s careful not to lose herself chasing danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141140/extras/87247680081e18c1da0e10577f7c6300.avif?t=1765835931\" width=182 height=178 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roya</strong> - A flirtatious young man who, after meeting the heroine, seems drawn to her for reasons beyond simple attraction. His true motives remain a mystery. Though his uniform marks him as a student from her school, she’s certain she’s never seen him before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141140/extras/994dc0a016fa0c6f2451bdfd4fc1cb2f.avif?t=1765835931\" width=182 height=178 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chain</strong> - A man of few words, he only speaks when it truly matters or to make a cutting comment. His quiet nature, paired with his strange activities, has fueled rumors that he’s connected to the murders.</p>",
